mazelib-ts-tx
=============

This is a TypeScript port of mazelib (https://github.com/john-science/mazelib),
translated from the Python source at commit
56cd88294a36746bbd324c2c9f7e4ab26095deb3 (version 0.9.17). It is a derivative
work of mazelib.

